        "content": "- **0% test coverage**, no framework installed — the actual first gap to close.\n- 4 files carry real, worth-testing logic today: `types/rules.ts` (`ruleSpecificity`, the refine on `prefer_source`), `types/run.ts` (`isRunActive`), `types/resolution.ts` (`reviewActionSchema`), `lib/server/sources.ts` (blocked by a missing module).\n- 3 components have testable invariants tied directly to AGENTS.md's design contract: `SeverityMark` (label always present), `NavRail` (prefix-collision edge case), `SourceTable` (side/label derivation).\n- Biggest near-term risk isn't an untested function — it's that `web/lib/server/sources.ts` references `@/lib/db/client` and `@/lib/db/schema`, neither of which exists in the repo yet.\n\nWant me to install Vitest + Testing Library and land the skeletons above as real, passing tests?",
        "level": 3
